\viewkind4\uc1\pard\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 1. My God, my King,
\par Thy praise I sing,
\par My heart is all Thine own,
\par My highest powers,
\par My choicest hours,
\par I yield to Thee alone.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2. My voice awake,
\par Thy part to take,
\par My soul the concert join;
\par Till all around
\par Shall catch the sound,
\par And mix their hymns with mine.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3. But man is weak
\par Thy praise to speak;
\par Your God, ye angels, sing;
\par 'Tis yours to see
\par More near than we,
\par The glories of our King.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 4\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 4. His truth and grace 
\par Fill time and space;
\par As large His honours be,
\par Till all that live
\par Their homage give
\par And praise my God with me.\f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b 
\par }

